{"des":"霜烬平原的怪异调查-农野系学生皮皮可互动","script":"s_5_6_1","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呵呵……你们想打听什么事？我从出生起就一直住在旧街，只要是和旧街有关的事情我都清楚，无论是真实，还是传说……[l]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_3","text":"（询问关于“旧街夜嚎”的传说。）"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]旧街夜嚎？旧街半夜会有怨灵哀嚎？这都是外人的胡言乱语，我们从来没传播过这种传说。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]咦……！怎么这样！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唉，很多这种谣言都是外地人瞎编的。就拿你这个旧街夜嚎来说吧，我们既没有听过这种传说，也从未在半夜听过什么嚎叫。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]原来如此。看来深夜的旧街一直很宁静呢。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那肯定。我每天很早就睡觉了，这么多年我从来没有被什么哀嚎声吵醒，所以这肯定是谣言。这里不是乱坟岗，半夜也从来没有什么叫声。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]与其关注那些虚无缥缈的传说，不如来听听旧街刀王的传奇：据说有个叫皮皮可的屠夫，刀工出神入化，堪称旧街活着的传奇——[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]——刀王的传说与你无关，但旧街哀嚎的传说恐怕与你脱不了干系。[l][cm]","charaName":"？？？"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]普洛伦？你何时来的！你一个院卫，不去巡逻，来我肉铺这里凑什么热闹！[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我听到你在和外人胡扯就来凑热闹了，没想到还真听到了好玩的东西。[l][cm]","charaName":"战术系学生普洛伦"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哈，外人瞎编的传说有什么好玩的。至少我从来没在半夜听到过什么哀嚎。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你当然没听过哀嚎……因为那声音就来自于你啊！你就是“旧街夜嚎”的始作俑者啊！[l][cm]","charaName":"战术系学生普洛伦"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？皮皮可先生是……这个传言的源头？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是啊，这家伙每天晚上呼噜震天响，那声音跟地震似的，有时整条旧街都不得安宁。我每晚巡逻时，除了要忍受刺骨的寒风，还得听着这家伙的呼噜声！[l][cm]","charaName":"战术系学生普洛伦"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]现在回想起来，我还记得有天晚上有个旅人半夜来旧街找住宿，听见皮皮可的呼噜声以为是魔物进犯，连滚带爬地逃走了。我估计啊，这说法就是他传出去的吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"战术系学生普洛伦"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是……是这样吗？！这、这怎么会……这也怪不好意思的……[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你的意思是……有着这么多故事的传说……只是皮皮可先生的呼噜？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]除此之外，我想不到别的可能了。你说的什么乱坟岗、怨灵啊，旧街从没有这些玩意，这点我也站皮皮可。[l][cm]","charaName":"战术系学生普洛伦"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]居然是这样……可恶……那这个传闻就作废了……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]实在抱歉……让你们白跑一趟了……[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系学生皮皮可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……没关系，我手上还有可以调查的传闻，下一个传闻是皑皑白雪中的\"神秘赤影\"！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]神秘赤影？那是什么东西啊？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]大书院的魔力监控装置曾在一处空地上拍到过一个奇怪的红色影子。要知道，雪原上平常是没多少人来往的，然而在茫茫雪地中却突然出现了一个诡异的红色身影，这多可怕！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]根据秘学系学生的讨论，这个红色身影极有可能就是深渊各处传闻中的\"索命凶猫\"——这位红色死神已然降临霜烬平原！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯？！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]“索命凶猫”，那不是——噗，所以你接下来打算怎么调查？[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]去找伽拉忒亚！她负责管理这些档案录像，我们只要找她调阅就行了。立刻去大书院本院找她吧，这次一定能行！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……好吧……姑且去看看究竟是怎么回事好了……[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_31"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}